<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Valentine's Day, Jojo ❤️</title>
    <style>
        body {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff9a9e, #fecfef);
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: auto;
            position: relative;
        }
        .heart {
            color: red;
            font-size: 50px;
            animation: heartbeat 1s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes heartbeat {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.3); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }
        .message {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: red;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 16px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: darkred;
        }
        .hidden {
            display: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>Happy Valentine's Day, Jojo! ❤️</h2>
        <p class="heart">❤️❤️❤️</p>
        <p class="message">Click below for a special surprise!</p>
        <button class="button" onclick="showMessage()">Open</button>
        <p id="specialMessage" class="hidden">
            My dearest Jojo, <br><br>
            This is our **third Valentine's Day together**, but our **first as parents-to-be!** 💖<br>
            From the moment we got married on **April 17, 2022**, every day with you has been a blessing. <br>
            Now, as we wait for our little one to arrive, my love and respect for you have grown even more. <br><br>
            You are the most wonderful partner and will be the most amazing mother. ❤️ <br>
            I promise to stand by your side in every moment, every joy, and every challenge. <br><br>
            **I love you forever, Jojo!** 😘<br>
            - Yours always, Guddu
        </p>
    </div>

    <script>
        function showMessage() {
            document.getElementById("specialMessage").classList.remove("hidden");
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
